WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:01:39.126
[ Watch on KissFlix.co ]

2
01:39.396 --> 01:41.553
[Episode 36]

3
01:45.040 --> 01:47.040
Lift your arm a bit.

4
01:49.000 --> 01:50.326
Almost done.

5
01:51.420 --> 01:53.260
- It hurts... - Remember to change the dressing.

6
01:54.040 --> 01:55.340
It hurts...

7
01:55.960 --> 01:57.259
It hurts...

8
01:58.780 --> 02:00.239
I need medicine.

9
02:01.760 --> 02:03.340
I need medicine.

10
02:04.859 --> 02:06.159
It hurts...

11
02:10.520 --> 02:12.317
Here, take your medicine.

12
02:12.317 --> 02:13.716
Prop yourself up a bit.

13
02:20.000 --> 02:21.699
Thank you, Madam.

14
02:25.400 --> 02:26.580
Here.

15
02:31.120 --> 02:32.400
Madam,

16
02:33.280 --> 02:37.921
do you think we can hold Nanping?

17
02:42.000 --> 02:43.073
We can.

18
02:43.699 --> 02:45.000
We will.

19
02:46.919 --> 02:48.300
Good.

20
02:49.419 --> 02:53.159
Then when this is over, I'm going home.

21
02:55.500 --> 02:57.659
My mother is waiting for me.

22
03:05.160 --> 03:09.653
[To Mother]

23
03:16.000 --> 03:21.480
Madam, you've seen more of the world than we have.

24
03:23.159 --> 03:28.860
This war, Chinese fighting Chinese...

25
03:29.699 --> 03:34.840
When will it ever end?

26
03:37.480 --> 03:43.866
I lost this arm to our own countrymen.

27
03:45.720 --> 03:47.280
It wasn't worth it.

28
04:22.920 --> 04:26.620
Don't waste brave soldiers fighting their own people.

29
04:27.279 --> 04:30.519
When will we finally unite against the enemy outside our borders?

30
04:30.519 --> 04:35.813
Only then will our own blood cease to stain this land.

31
04:43.666 --> 04:46.700
Flank them from both sides! Wait till they're close.

32
05:18.040 --> 05:19.360
Charge!

33
06:51.840 --> 06:53.140
You're back.

34
07:00.480 --> 07:01.801
Did I wake you?

35
07:04.480 --> 07:05.753
No, stay in bed.

36
07:14.560 --> 07:16.899
Your hands are freezing.

37
07:16.899 --> 07:17.939
Let me warm them.

38
07:17.939 --> 07:19.139
Don't be silly.

39
07:21.240 --> 07:24.184
Finally got the quilt warm,

40
07:24.184 --> 07:25.980
and now you're touching my ice-cold hands.

41
07:25.980 --> 07:27.420
You'll get cold again.

42
07:34.840 --> 07:36.100
Your stubble...

43
07:36.899 --> 07:38.326
It's prickly.

44
07:44.880 --> 07:46.803
I've been so busy these past few days.

45
07:46.803 --> 07:48.483
I forgot to shave my stubble.

46
08:08.420 --> 08:10.300
The way things are going,

47
08:12.019 --> 08:14.779
even if Chang Xuan wins this battle,

48
08:16.080 --> 08:19.159
there won't be much left of the Yu Army.

49
08:20.520 --> 08:22.780
We're nearly out of men.

50
08:23.640 --> 08:25.600
I understand.

51
08:25.600 --> 08:28.120
The Yu Army is your life's work.

52
08:28.120 --> 08:31.839
It's what lets you protect this region.

53
08:31.839 --> 08:34.080
And you're worried about Master Chang Xuan.

54
08:34.080 --> 08:37.659
Every time the phone rings, you--

55
08:47.440 --> 08:50.840
Commander, we've got words back from the Jun family.

56
08:50.840 --> 08:53.464
- What do they say? - Deputy Minister Jun says

57
08:53.464 --> 08:55.880
he can go through his brother to pressure the Central Government

58
08:55.880 --> 09:00.930
into cutting off all military and logistical support to the Chu-Mou forces immediately.

59
09:00.930 --> 09:02.693
That would be a huge help.

60
09:02.693 --> 09:07.940
But he attached one condition.

61
09:07.940 --> 09:09.080
What condition?

62
09:09.080 --> 09:13.000
He says if we want their full support,

63
09:13.000 --> 09:15.561
there has to be a marriage between our two families.

64
09:29.560 --> 09:30.761
Chang Xuan.

65
09:32.320 --> 09:33.620
What is it?

66
09:33.620 --> 09:35.179
We just decrypted a telegram.

67
09:36.600 --> 09:39.326
The Central Government's support for Chu-Mou forces is way more than we thought.

68
09:39.326 --> 09:42.620
Besides guns and funds, they've sent three artillery regiments.

69
09:43.200 --> 09:47.899
So they're dead set on using Chu-Mou forces

70
09:47.899 --> 09:50.426
to finish us off.

71
10:26.320 --> 10:29.780
Ping Jun, what's wrong?

72
10:32.639 --> 10:34.120
Nothing.

73
10:57.560 --> 11:00.540
Congratulations, Deputy Commander. Your wife is pregnant.

74
11:01.259 --> 11:03.159
Really?

75
11:03.159 --> 11:04.159
Yes.

76
11:04.159 --> 11:06.120
But it's a little unstable right now.

77
11:06.120 --> 11:10.006
She needs complete rest, and she can't exert herself anymore.

78
11:57.320 --> 12:01.960
Ping Jun, you're going to be a mother.

79
12:06.080 --> 12:07.960
And you're going to be a father.

80
12:11.899 --> 12:13.740
I just wonder...

81
12:14.460 --> 12:19.120
will it be a girl, or a boy, a little troublemaker?

82
12:20.560 --> 12:22.279
What?

83
12:22.279 --> 12:25.639
If it's a boy, will you love him more?

84
12:26.860 --> 12:28.379
I like girls.

85
12:29.080 --> 12:30.500
A girl would look like you.

86
12:32.840 --> 12:38.000
I've heard pregnant women should eat lots of apples

87
12:38.000 --> 12:41.080
so the baby comes out with clear skin,

88
12:41.080 --> 12:46.004
and plenty of sesame and walnuts so the baby's smart.

89
12:46.004 --> 12:49.957
When you get back to Nanhuai, tell Mother whatever you want to eat.

90
12:49.957 --> 12:55.140
Once she knows you're pregnant, she'll do everything she can to cheer you up.

91
12:59.500 --> 13:01.240
I'm not going back to Nanhuai.

92
13:01.240 --> 13:05.000
I'm staying here with you.

93
13:05.000 --> 13:09.137
Ping Jun, now that you're pregnant,

94
13:10.440 --> 13:15.601
having you at the front would worry me even more.

95
13:20.840 --> 13:27.020
Let me focus on the fight, win this battle, and come back to you.

96
13:28.760 --> 13:29.760
Alright?

97
13:31.560 --> 13:33.120
Yu Chang Xuan.

98
13:36.680 --> 13:39.021
My mother and Jin Xuan both say

99
13:40.200 --> 13:43.639
pregnant women mustn't cry.

100
13:44.200 --> 13:48.439
Cry too much, and the baby comes out ugly.

101
13:50.019 --> 13:51.966
Nonsense.

102
14:11.800 --> 14:16.920
Right now, you and the baby are my greatest weakness.

103
14:18.200 --> 14:24.000
Only when you and the baby are safe can I fight with a clear head.

104
14:25.200 --> 14:30.940
I know I haven't been a good husband,

105
14:32.160 --> 14:33.479
but from now on,

106
14:34.120 --> 14:36.659
I'll try to be a good father.

107
14:38.200 --> 14:39.680
For you both,

108
14:41.825 --> 14:44.240
I'll do everything I can.

109
14:51.040 --> 14:57.006
Then promise me you'll come back safe.

110
15:08.879 --> 15:10.180
I promise.

111
15:22.220 --> 15:24.400
While Daddy's away,

112
15:24.400 --> 15:26.260
be good for your mom.

113
15:26.920 --> 15:29.880
No mischief, understand?

114
16:19.680 --> 16:22.280
We're almost at the wharf, Madam.

115
16:23.920 --> 16:25.360
All right.

116
16:25.360 --> 16:29.413
Let's go home and wait for Daddy together.

117
16:57.160 --> 16:58.500
Three, five, six, four.

118
16:59.919 --> 17:01.139
Zero, six, four.

119
17:01.139 --> 17:02.399
Director Gu!

120
17:03.200 --> 17:04.700
Director Gu!

121
17:04.700 --> 17:05.799
Director Gu!

122
17:05.799 --> 17:07.660
Director... Director Gu.

123
17:07.660 --> 17:08.660
What is it?

124
17:09.339 --> 17:11.440
Director Gu, a word in private.

125
17:38.960 --> 17:40.879
Are you sure about this?

126
17:49.079 --> 17:51.299
Are you sure about this?

127
17:51.299 --> 17:52.660
Absolutely sure.

128
18:09.759 --> 18:14.680
If we swing around from the flank to their rear and hit their elite regiment directly,

129
18:14.680 --> 18:17.059
we might still have a chance.

130
18:17.059 --> 18:19.680
Right, Chu Wen Fu's elite regiment is tough to deal with,

131
18:19.680 --> 18:22.279
but after all the fighting, they're down to about 30 percent strength.

132
18:22.279 --> 18:24.119
Have the casualty figures come in?

133
18:24.119 --> 18:25.680
I'll go compile them.

134
18:29.480 --> 18:32.233
Rui Tong. What's wrong?

135
18:34.000 --> 18:35.500
What's the matter with you?

136
18:38.039 --> 18:39.339
What is it, Rui Tong?

137
18:46.259 --> 18:47.579
What's going on?

138
18:51.779 --> 18:53.059
Chang Xuan...

139
18:56.940 --> 18:58.039
Everyone out.

140
18:58.039 --> 18:59.359
- Yes, sir. - Yes, sir.

141
19:06.220 --> 19:07.359
What is it?

142
19:08.960 --> 19:15.619
The ship carrying Lady Ping Jun back to Nanhuai exploded near a mid-river island.

143
19:19.920 --> 19:21.279
What did you say?

144
19:22.320 --> 19:24.720
The ship caught fire after the explosion,

145
19:25.599 --> 19:29.099
and then... then it sank.

146
19:30.359 --> 19:34.413
No survivors.

147
19:44.880 --> 19:46.701
What the hell are you talking about?

148
19:48.460 --> 19:49.819
How is that possible?

149
19:51.040 --> 19:55.819
Their preliminary findings say that as the ship neared the north,

150
19:55.819 --> 19:58.393
one of Chu Wen Fu's ammunition transports came alongside.

151
20:16.520 --> 20:18.600
We were together just yesterday.

152
20:20.560 --> 20:22.400
You must have heard wrong.

153
20:27.920 --> 20:29.339
- Chang Xuan! - Master Chang Xuan!

154
20:29.339 --> 20:30.940
Master Chang Xuan, are you all right?

155
20:30.940 --> 20:32.420
Master Chang Xuan! Master Chang Xuan!

156
20:32.420 --> 20:33.759
Master Chang Xuan!

157
20:33.759 --> 20:35.259
Get the medical officer!

158
20:35.259 --> 20:37.799
Get the medical officer! Hurry!

159
20:37.799 --> 20:39.599
Quick!

160
20:43.040 --> 20:46.240
[Yu's Mansion]

161
21:08.839 --> 21:12.000
Mother, who was on the phone?

162
21:13.220 --> 21:15.266
You don't look well.

163
21:17.080 --> 21:18.766
How could this be?

164
21:20.119 --> 21:21.640
Ping Jun...

165
21:22.560 --> 21:24.339
What happened to Ping Jun?

166
21:24.339 --> 21:27.173
Wasn't she coming home?

167
21:31.880 --> 21:34.660
The ship caught fire on the river.

168
21:40.119 --> 21:41.806
She's dead.

169
21:44.720 --> 21:49.099
Mother, do you mean Ping Jun is...

170
21:49.099 --> 21:51.559
Mother, has it been confirmed?

171
21:51.559 --> 21:54.400
Was it Gu Rui Tong on the phone?

172
21:55.220 --> 21:57.420
Rui Tong told me himself.

173
22:01.779 --> 22:04.539
Ping Jun was pregnant.

174
22:10.440 --> 22:12.020
How could this be?

175
23:10.299 --> 23:13.900
How did you tear your shirt?

176
23:13.900 --> 23:15.599
I don't remember.

177
23:37.160 --> 23:40.946
You've been up several nights straight writing those front-line reports.

178
23:41.680 --> 23:43.440
Don't push yourself so hard.

179
23:43.440 --> 23:45.417
They're firsthand accounts.

180
23:45.417 --> 23:47.793
I want to get them all down as quickly as I can.

181
24:07.760 --> 24:08.913
Ping Jun,

182
24:10.759 --> 24:13.160
I understand why you write them

183
24:15.160 --> 24:18.160
and what you're trying to do.

184
24:18.740 --> 24:24.039
But every minute on the battlefield is dangerous.

185
24:25.920 --> 24:27.859
I know what you're worried about.

186
24:27.859 --> 24:29.519
Don't worry.

187
24:29.519 --> 24:31.419
I'll take care of myself.

188
24:32.360 --> 24:35.000
I want people to see

189
24:35.000 --> 24:39.120
that the Chinese shouldn't be shedding blood in a civil war.

190
24:43.700 --> 24:50.059
Then promise me you'll stay in the rear.

191
24:51.080 --> 24:53.380
You cannot go anywhere near the front line.

192
24:57.000 --> 25:00.966
I would never put myself in danger.

193
25:26.480 --> 25:29.026
Prepare a good burial plot

194
25:30.400 --> 25:35.679
for Ye Ping Jun and her child

195
25:37.279 --> 25:42.080
at the cemetery in the western suburbs.

196
25:43.160 --> 25:44.360
Commander.

197
25:45.200 --> 25:48.380
No one could have foreseen this.

198
25:49.680 --> 25:51.000
Sorry for your loss.

199
25:52.579 --> 25:54.859
You don't understand.

200
25:55.940 --> 26:00.740
It feels like

201
26:00.740 --> 26:04.020
a piece has been cruelly carved out.

202
26:05.579 --> 26:07.666
A huge piece.

203
26:23.420 --> 26:25.960
By the time we've come this far,

204
26:28.280 --> 26:31.200
my hands are covered in blood.

205
26:33.320 --> 26:34.960
From the moment

206
26:37.539 --> 26:40.986
I gave my word to the Jun family,

207
26:43.080 --> 26:46.580
and there was no turning back.

208
26:53.335 --> 26:58.273
[Jiang City]

209
27:03.560 --> 27:04.900
Councilor Jiang,

210
27:04.900 --> 27:08.280
some elder statesmen in Nanjing have jointly recommended you for the Legislative Council.

211
27:08.280 --> 27:10.420
Word's out,

212
27:10.420 --> 27:15.359
and every big name in town is lining up to congratulate you.

213
27:17.440 --> 27:19.720
You're young, capable, learned,

214
27:19.720 --> 27:22.500
and favored by the senior statesmen at the center.

215
27:22.500 --> 27:26.700
Your mansion is going to be packed with visitors.

216
27:26.700 --> 27:30.259
If Madam knew, she'd be overjoyed.

217
27:30.840 --> 27:31.999
We're not going home.

218
27:33.840 --> 27:35.320
Take me to the other house.

219
27:35.320 --> 27:36.520
Yes, sir.

220
27:40.080 --> 27:43.720
[Jiang's Mansion]

221
27:47.560 --> 27:48.853
- Councilor Jiang. - Councilor Jiang.

222
27:51.079 --> 27:52.279
Councilor Jiang.

223
27:54.279 --> 27:55.920
Leave us.

224
27:55.920 --> 27:57.039
Yes, sir.

225
28:24.019 --> 28:28.626
Jiang Xue Ting, you dare do this to me?

226
28:30.799 --> 28:32.260
You're back.

227
28:34.760 --> 28:36.040
Ping Jun,

228
28:41.039 --> 28:42.833
we're finally together again.

229
28:44.520 --> 28:48.292
You're someone important now.

230
28:48.292 --> 28:50.692
You should act with some decency.

231
28:51.940 --> 28:54.519
What do you think you're doing, kidnapping me and holding me here?

232
28:55.539 --> 28:57.440
I want to go back to Nanhuai.

233
28:57.440 --> 29:00.420
Ping Jun, you're angry again.

234
29:00.420 --> 29:04.000
I remember when we were children, whenever you got angry,

235
29:04.000 --> 29:06.020
all I had to do was apologize first.

236
29:06.640 --> 29:08.906
Let me apologize to you again, all right?

237
29:09.799 --> 29:11.539
Get your hands off me.

238
29:13.819 --> 29:15.019
Ping Jun,

239
29:16.800 --> 29:18.681
whenever I'm feeling down,

240
29:19.440 --> 29:20.960
I want to see you.

241
29:22.440 --> 29:28.099
But I've never wanted to see you as desperately, as wildly as I do now.

242
29:29.480 --> 29:33.113
I've been thinking that you were meant to be my woman.

243
29:33.920 --> 29:37.740
And one day, I'll take you back.

244
29:40.640 --> 29:41.921
Ping Jun!

245
29:45.720 --> 29:48.960
Jiang Xue Ting, you're despicable.

246
29:48.960 --> 29:51.700
Yes, I am.

247
29:52.880 --> 29:57.220
For you, I'll gladly be despicable.

248
29:57.220 --> 30:01.183
I once thought that if I had all of this,

249
30:01.183 --> 30:03.813
it wouldn't matter if I didn't have you.

250
30:04.920 --> 30:08.579
But I've learned that I can have everything

251
30:08.579 --> 30:12.840
and still can't go on without you.

252
30:12.840 --> 30:17.790
You've married Tao Zi Yi, and I've married Yu Chang Xuan.

253
30:17.790 --> 30:20.220
You know very well this is impossible.

254
30:20.220 --> 30:22.140
I say it's possible.

255
30:47.000 --> 30:48.280
Guards!

256
30:52.579 --> 30:53.960
Councilor Jiang.

257
30:53.960 --> 30:56.380
Get a doctor. Now.

258
30:56.380 --> 30:57.420
Yes, sir.

259
31:03.560 --> 31:05.500
Let go of me!

260
31:25.460 --> 31:27.673
You don't need a doctor.

261
31:30.019 --> 31:31.700
You are right.

262
31:34.120 --> 31:36.360
I'm carrying Yu Chang Xuan's child.

263
31:39.259 --> 31:43.700
Ye Ping Jun, you ungrateful woman!

264
31:43.700 --> 31:47.559
Yes. I am ungrateful.

265
31:47.559 --> 31:49.440
I'm not good enough for you. Then let me go!

266
31:49.440 --> 31:50.720
Dream on.

267
31:52.759 --> 31:56.960
I will never let you have anything to do with Yu Chang Xuan again.

268
31:56.960 --> 31:58.440
Jiang Xue Ting,

269
31:59.420 --> 32:00.920
listen,

270
32:02.000 --> 32:04.326
my mother knows what you're doing.

271
32:05.800 --> 32:09.460
Aren't you afraid you'll pay for this?

272
32:12.960 --> 32:15.160
If I'm going to pay for anything,

273
32:15.160 --> 32:18.553
I'll start by getting rid of that cursed child of his in your belly.

274
32:19.299 --> 32:21.059
Then let me make this clear.

275
32:22.220 --> 32:24.280
Don't you dare touch my child.

276
32:39.299 --> 32:40.640
Let me go!

277
32:41.740 --> 32:46.173
So you can take his child and run back to him?

278
32:46.980 --> 32:49.080
Not a chance.

279
32:49.080 --> 32:51.740
That child cannot be born.

280
32:57.840 --> 33:00.020
If you dare hurt it,

281
33:03.120 --> 33:07.060
if you dare do anything to keep this child from being born safe and sound,

282
33:11.420 --> 33:13.359
I'll kill myself right here, right now.

283
33:14.760 --> 33:16.260
I mean it.

284
33:28.779 --> 33:30.019
Fine.

285
33:32.320 --> 33:33.553
Fine.

286
33:35.440 --> 33:37.666
Ye Ping Jun, you're ruthless.

287
33:38.940 --> 33:42.039
You can keep this child for the time being.

288
33:42.840 --> 33:44.440
But I'm warning you,

289
33:45.800 --> 33:48.826
you'd better stay put and behave.

290
33:49.720 --> 33:52.619
Don't get any ideas.

291
35:15.040 --> 35:20.600
Since it's already happened, we have to face it.

292
35:21.520 --> 35:27.560
I came to tell you that I've read the articles

293
35:30.000 --> 35:31.646
Ping Jun wrote at the front.

294
35:33.199 --> 35:35.519
She wrote about the wounded soldiers' pain,

295
35:36.520 --> 35:38.620
the soldiers' longing for home,

296
35:39.480 --> 35:44.360
the ordinary people's fear of being driven from place to place.

297
35:45.360 --> 35:48.099
But she didn't just write about suffering.

298
35:48.099 --> 35:53.600
She was asking how much longer this endless infighting,

299
35:53.600 --> 35:58.200
this tragedy of Chinese killing Chinese,

300
35:58.200 --> 36:00.026
would go on.

301
36:00.880 --> 36:05.180
How much more blood would have to be shed before it stopped.

302
36:07.380 --> 36:08.626
Jin,

303
36:10.680 --> 36:13.100
I hate myself.

304
36:15.040 --> 36:17.720
Why couldn't I protect them?

305
36:18.420 --> 36:19.740
Chang Xuan,

306
36:20.893 --> 36:25.532
you may never be free of this pain,

307
36:27.739 --> 36:30.280
and no one can truly feel what you feel.

308
36:31.400 --> 36:35.520
I know you and Ping Jun weren't just a loving husband and wife.

309
36:36.160 --> 36:41.000
You were also comrades, kindred spirits fighting side by side.

310
36:41.000 --> 36:46.500
But that's exactly why you can't fall now.

311
36:47.139 --> 36:50.940
Now, the old order hasn't died, the new one hasn't taken shape,

312
36:50.940 --> 36:53.200
and all that's left is war everywhere.

313
36:54.320 --> 36:59.933
I know you're not the Yu Chang Xuan you used to be.

314
37:01.520 --> 37:06.259
What weighs on you now isn't just whether the Yu Army survives.

315
37:07.000 --> 37:09.213
It's the well-being of the people of Nanhuai,

316
37:09.900 --> 37:14.519
and even the future of this country.

317
37:16.139 --> 37:21.840
The Central Government is like a drafty house, and sooner or later it will collapse.

318
37:22.599 --> 37:26.960
Every warlord is standing at a crossroads in history.

319
37:27.760 --> 37:30.380
You have every right to grieve,

320
37:30.380 --> 37:34.800
but you can't let yourself decay and exile yourself from the world.

321
37:36.200 --> 37:40.059
You lie here wanting to die, thinking it will end all your troubles.

322
37:41.159 --> 37:47.679
But have you thought about what Ping Jun would want most?

323
37:48.960 --> 37:51.460
Would she want you to sink into despair and follow her,

324
37:52.300 --> 37:56.619
or would she want you to stand up and bring about the future she wrote about,

325
37:56.619 --> 38:01.039
where children don't have to lose their fathers and wives don't have to lose their husbands?

326
38:09.760 --> 38:11.673
Please, for Ping Jun,

327
38:13.800 --> 38:15.361
for your child,

328
38:17.800 --> 38:19.720
and for your brother,

329
38:22.400 --> 38:23.900
go and see...

330
38:25.239 --> 38:30.280
the better days they never got to see.

331
39:09.960 --> 39:15.480
[A Nation Weeps as Brothers Fight On When Will Chinese Stop Killing Chinese?]

332
39:50.960 --> 39:53.139
Machine guns on the low ground to the left!

333
39:53.139 --> 39:54.380
Pin down their charge!

334
39:54.380 --> 39:55.380
Yes, sir!

335
40:02.880 --> 40:03.880
Fire!

336
40:20.079 --> 40:21.520
Pour it on!

337
40:26.460 --> 40:27.719
Second Company, come with me!

338
40:27.719 --> 40:29.519
Take back our lost position!

339
40:29.519 --> 40:31.900
- Go! - Go!

340
40:31.900 --> 40:34.786
- Charge! - Charge!

341
40:37.420 --> 40:39.953
Men, follow me!

342
40:40.520 --> 40:42.660
- Charge! - Charge!

343
41:04.600 --> 41:07.040
Governor, logistics just confirmed it

344
41:07.840 --> 41:12.059
that the Central Government ordered the last ammunition shipment turned back en route.

345
41:12.059 --> 41:14.840
The American legation has formally protested to the Central Government

346
41:14.840 --> 41:17.293
and demanded all our supplies be suspended.

347
41:18.980 --> 41:20.320
On what grounds?

348
41:20.320 --> 41:23.320
To avoid unnecessary escalation of the regional conflict

349
41:23.320 --> 41:24.960
and urge all parties to exercise restraint.

350
41:26.160 --> 41:29.699
"Unnecessary escalation." What a phrase.

351
41:29.699 --> 41:35.719
Yu Zhong Quan finally got through to the Jun family.

352
41:35.719 --> 41:37.800
Cut the supply line. A fine move.

353
41:37.800 --> 41:39.966
He played this hand beautifully.

354
41:40.680 --> 41:43.699
Governor, the Yu Army's attack is too fierce.

355
41:43.699 --> 41:45.353
We can't hold!

356
41:54.600 --> 41:59.566
Our supplies are cut, and our enemy is fighting to the death.

357
42:21.320 --> 42:23.273
Move! Fall back!

358
42:24.019 --> 42:25.159
Move!

359
42:30.699 --> 42:32.139
Fall back!

360
43:34.835 --> 43:37.113
[Three months later]

361
44:10.880 --> 44:14.099
So after all these years, Ye Ping Jun,

362
44:14.099 --> 44:17.640
here you are again,

363
44:17.640 --> 44:23.720
locked up by a man, kept like a bird in a gilded cage.

364
44:28.420 --> 44:29.880
Miss Tao.

365
44:31.600 --> 44:33.973
I just want to get out of here.

366
44:35.480 --> 44:37.120
Are you begging me?

367
44:41.099 --> 44:44.960
Jiang Xue Ting went through all that trouble to get you here.

368
44:44.960 --> 44:47.760
How could he just let you go?

369
44:47.760 --> 44:51.119
Back then, you took Chang Xuan from me.

370
44:51.119 --> 44:52.900
You took my father from me.

371
44:52.900 --> 44:55.119
And now you're in my hands.

372
44:55.800 --> 44:57.977
I'm not a man.

373
44:57.977 --> 44:59.773
Your charms won't work on me.

374
45:06.160 --> 45:08.060
I'm pregnant.

375
45:08.960 --> 45:11.400
This is Chang Xuan's child.

376
45:13.840 --> 45:15.046
What?

377
45:16.440 --> 45:18.360
Are you trying to show off?

378
45:19.840 --> 45:22.046
I'm not showing off.

379
45:22.880 --> 45:27.953
I'm telling you why I have to leave.

380
45:29.400 --> 45:31.320
As a mother,

381
45:32.600 --> 45:34.786
I only want my child to be safe.

382
45:47.679 --> 45:52.453
When I told you just now that this is Chang Xuan's child,

383
45:54.059 --> 45:56.800
I didn't see anger in your eyes.

384
45:59.080 --> 46:05.880
He is no longer the man in your heart,

385
46:05.880 --> 46:07.033
right?

386
46:13.440 --> 46:15.606
You do see right through things.

387
46:23.080 --> 46:27.866
By staying here, I'm causing you trouble.

388
46:28.840 --> 46:30.766
And for me, it's like being locked in a cage.

389
46:33.960 --> 46:35.513
Let me go.

390
46:37.739 --> 46:40.059
It's better for all of us.

391
46:51.559 --> 46:56.640
I might pity any woman in this position.

392
47:00.559 --> 47:05.000
But Ye Ping Jun, you're the exception.

393
47:05.600 --> 47:07.579
More than anyone,

394
47:07.579 --> 47:13.440
I want to see you live the rest of your life in utter misery.
